<p>
<table style="background-color:black; width:75%; border-spacing:1px" >
  <tr>
    <td colspan="3" style="color:white; font-size:10pt; width:70%; background-color:#224477; text-align:center">
      <b>Primary data sources</b>
    </td>
    <td rowspan="4">
    </td>
    <td style="white-space:nowrap; color:white; font-size:10pt; background-color:#446655; text-align:center">
      <table style="border:thin hidden;text-align:center;width:100%">
        <tr>
          <td style="text-align:center; white-space:nowrap">Query NIST Bibliographic Databases for</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="text-align:center"><b>Ne  I</b> (new window)</td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td class='brt1'>
      Energy Levels:
    </td>
    <td class='bcn'>
      &nbsp;<a onmouseover="self.status='Bibliographic Reference for Ne I';return true;" onmouseout="self.status='';return true;" target="_blank" href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="popded('https://physics.nist.gov/cgi-bin/ASBib1/get_ASBib_ref.cgi?db=el&amp;db_id=8826&amp;comment_code=&amp;element=Ne&amp;spectr_charge=1&amp;type=E');return false">Saloman and Sansonetti 2004</a>&nbsp;
    </td>
    <td class='blf'>
      
    </td>
    <td class='bcn1'>
      <a href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="popbib('https://physics.nist.gov/cgi-bin/ASBib1/Elevbib/make_query.cgi?spectra=Ne%20I&amp;method=EL&amp;method=TE&amp;method=ND&amp;method=IP&amp;method=SF&amp;method=QF&amp;order=1');return false"
        onmouseover="self.status='Ne  I: bibliography energy levels query';return true;"
        onmouseout="self.status=''; return true;" target="_blank">Ne  I Energy Levels</a>
    </td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td class='brt1'>
      Lines:
    </td>
    <td class='bcn'>
      &nbsp;<a onmouseover="self.status='Bibliographic Reference for Ne I';return true;" onmouseout="self.status='';return true;" target="_blank" href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="popded('https://physics.nist.gov/cgi-bin/ASBib1/get_ASBib_ref.cgi?db=el&amp;db_id=8826&amp;comment_code=&amp;element=Ne&amp;spectr_charge=1&amp;type=L');return false">Saloman and Sansonetti 2004</a>&nbsp;
    </td>
    <td class='blf'>
      
    </td>
    <td class='bcn1'>
      <a href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="popbib('https://physics.nist.gov/cgi-bin/ASBib1/Elevbib/make_query.cgi?spectra=Ne%20I&amp;method=W&amp;method=CL&amp;order=1');return false"
        onmouseover="self.status='Ne  I: bibliography wavelengths query';return true;"
        onmouseout="self.status=''; return true;" target="_blank">Ne  I Line Wavelengths and Classification</a>
    </td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td class='brt1'>
      Transition Probabilities:
    </td>
    <td class='bcn'>
      &nbsp;<a onmouseover="self.status='Bibliographic Reference for Ne I';return true;" onmouseout="self.status='';return true;" target="_blank" href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="popded('https://physics.nist.gov/cgi-bin/ASBib1/get_ASBib_ref.cgi?db=tp&amp;db_id=6976&amp;comment_code=&amp;element=Ne&amp;spectr_charge=1&amp;type=T');return false">Seaton&nbsp;1998</a>, <a onmouseover="self.status='Bibliographic Reference for Ne I';return true;" onmouseout="self.status='';return true;" target="_blank" href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="popded('https://physics.nist.gov/cgi-bin/ASBib1/get_ASBib_ref.cgi?db=tp&amp;db_id=2733&amp;comment_code=&amp;element=Ne&amp;spectr_charge=1&amp;type=T');return false">Inatsugu&nbsp;&&nbsp;Holmes&nbsp;1975</a>, <a onmouseover="self.status='Bibliographic Reference for Ne I';return true;" onmouseout="self.status='';return true;" target="_blank" href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="popded('https://physics.nist.gov/cgi-bin/ASBib1/get_ASBib_ref.cgi?db=tp&amp;db_id=2734&amp;comment_code=&amp;element=Ne&amp;spectr_charge=1&amp;type=T');return false">Inatsugu&nbsp;&&nbsp;Holmes&nbsp;1975</a>, <a onmouseover="self.status='Bibliographic Reference for Ne I';return true;" onmouseout="self.status='';return true;" target="_blank" href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="popded('https://physics.nist.gov/cgi-bin/ASBib1/get_ASBib_ref.cgi?db=tp&amp;db_id=2318&amp;comment_code=&amp;element=Ne&amp;spectr_charge=1&amp;type=T');return false">Inatsugu&nbsp;&&nbsp;Holmes&nbsp;1973</a>, <a onmouseover="self.status='Bibliographic Reference for Ne I';return true;" onmouseout="self.status='';return true;" target="_blank" href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="popded('https://physics.nist.gov/cgi-bin/ASBib1/get_ASBib_ref.cgi?db=tp&amp;db_id=8378&amp;comment_code=&amp;element=Ne&amp;spectr_charge=1&amp;type=T');return false">Bac&#322;awski&nbsp;2008</a>, <a onmouseover="self.status='Bibliographic Reference for Ne I';return true;" onmouseout="self.status='';return true;" target="_blank" href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="popded('https://physics.nist.gov/cgi-bin/ASBib1/get_ASBib_ref.cgi?db=tp&amp;db_id=6844&amp;comment_code=&amp;element=Ne&amp;spectr_charge=1&amp;type=T');return false">Zhong&nbsp;et&nbsp;al.&nbsp;1997</a>, <a onmouseover="self.status='Bibliographic Reference for Ne I';return true;" onmouseout="self.status='';return true;" target="_blank" href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="popded('https://physics.nist.gov/cgi-bin/ASBib1/get_ASBib_ref.cgi?db=tp&amp;db_id=5842&amp;comment_code=&amp;element=Ne&amp;spectr_charge=1&amp;type=T');return false">Chan&nbsp;et&nbsp;al.&nbsp;1992</a>, <a onmouseover="self.status='Bibliographic Reference for Ne I';return true;" onmouseout="self.status='';return true;" target="_blank" href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="popded('https://physics.nist.gov/cgi-bin/ASBib1/get_ASBib_ref.cgi?db=tp&amp;db_id=4701&amp;comment_code=&amp;element=Ne&amp;spectr_charge=1&amp;type=T');return false">Hartmetz&nbsp;&&nbsp;Schmoranzer&nbsp;1984</a>, <a onmouseover="self.status='Bibliographic Reference for Ne I';return true;" onmouseout="self.status='';return true;" target="_blank" href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="popded('https://physics.nist.gov/cgi-bin/ASBib1/get_ASBib_ref.cgi?db=tp&amp;db_id=3163&amp;comment_code=&amp;element=Ne&amp;spectr_charge=1&amp;type=T');return false">Czernichowski&nbsp;et&nbsp;al.&nbsp;1977</a>, <a onmouseover="self.status='Bibliographic Reference for Ne I';return true;" onmouseout="self.status='';return true;" target="_blank" href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="popded('https://physics.nist.gov/cgi-bin/ASBib1/get_ASBib_ref.cgi?db=tp&amp;db_id=6496&amp;comment_code=&amp;element=Ne&amp;spectr_charge=1&amp;type=T');return false">Gibson&nbsp;&&nbsp;Risley&nbsp;1995</a>, <a onmouseover="self.status='Bibliographic Reference for Ne I';return true;" onmouseout="self.status='';return true;" target="_blank" href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="popded('https://physics.nist.gov/cgi-bin/ASBib1/get_ASBib_ref.cgi?db=tp&amp;db_id=4273&amp;comment_code=&amp;element=Ne&amp;spectr_charge=1&amp;type=T');return false">Kandela&nbsp;&&nbsp;Schmoranzer&nbsp;1981</a>, <a onmouseover="self.status='Bibliographic Reference for Ne I';return true;" onmouseout="self.status='';return true;" target="_blank" href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="popded('https://physics.nist.gov/cgi-bin/ASBib1/get_ASBib_ref.cgi?db=tp&amp;db_id=6389&amp;comment_code=&amp;element=Ne&amp;spectr_charge=1&amp;type=T');return false">Kr&ouml;tz&nbsp;et&nbsp;al.&nbsp;1994</a>, <a onmouseover="self.status='Bibliographic Reference for Ne I';return true;" onmouseout="self.status='';return true;" target="_blank" href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="popded('https://physics.nist.gov/cgi-bin/ASBib1/get_ASBib_ref.cgi?db=tp&amp;db_id=2427&amp;comment_code=&amp;element=Ne&amp;spectr_charge=1&amp;type=T');return false">Starace&nbsp;1973</a>, <a onmouseover="self.status='Bibliographic Reference for Ne I';return true;" onmouseout="self.status='';return true;" target="_blank" href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="popded('https://physics.nist.gov/cgi-bin/ASBib1/get_ASBib_ref.cgi?db=tp&amp;db_id=2384&amp;comment_code=&amp;element=Ne&amp;spectr_charge=1&amp;type=T');return false">Nizio&#322;&nbsp;&&nbsp;S&#281;k&nbsp;1973</a>&nbsp;
    </td>
    <td class='blf'>
      &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Most of the <i>A</i>-values are from calculations of <a onmouseover="self.status='Bibliographic Reference for Ne I';return true;" onmouseout="self.status='';return true;" target="_blank" href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="popded('https://physics.nist.gov/cgi-bin/ASBib1/get_ASBib_ref.cgi?db=tp&amp;db_id=6976&amp;comment_code=&amp;element=Ne&amp;spectr_charge=1&amp;type=T');return false">Seaton&nbsp;1998 </a>. The high accuracy of these calculations is confirmed by comparisons with accurate measurements of Inatsugu&nbsp;&&nbsp;Holmes&nbsp;1975,1975, of Bac&#322;awski&nbsp;2008, of <a onmouseover="self.status='Bibliographic Reference for Ne I';return true;" onmouseout="self.status='';return true;" target="_blank" href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="popded('https://physics.nist.gov/cgi-bin/ASBib1/get_ASBib_ref.cgi?db=tp&amp;db_id=5460&amp;comment_code=&amp;element=Ne&amp;spectr_charge=1&amp;type=T');return false">Tanarro&nbsp;&&nbsp;Campos&nbsp;1985 </a>, and several other experimetal studies. Accuracy of the calculated <i>A</i>-values has been estimated using the method described by <a onmouseover="self.status='Bibliographic Reference for Ne I';return true;" onmouseout="self.status='';return true;" target="_blank" href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="popded('https://physics.nist.gov/cgi-bin/ASBib1/get_ASBib_ref.cgi?db=el&amp;db_id=18395&amp;comment_code=&amp;element=Ne&amp;spectr_charge=1&amp;type=T');return false">Kramida&nbsp;2013 </a>. The present data set was prepared by A.&nbsp;Kramida for the release of ASD v.5.6 in September 2018.
    </td>
    <td class='bcn1'>
      <a href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="popbib('https://physics.nist.gov/cgi-bin/ASBib1/Fvalbib/make_query.cgi?spectra=Ne%20I&amp;order=1');return false"
        onmouseover="self.status='Ne  I: bibliography transition probability query';return true;"
        onmouseout="self.status=''; return true;" target="_blank">Ne  I Transition Probabilities</a>
    </td>
  </tr>
</table>
